n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-615747f elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"615747f\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" src=\"https://hdmarine.com.tr/wp-content/uploads/2024/09/HD-33-300x300.jpg\" class=\"attachment-medium size-medium wp-image-534\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://hdmarine.com.tr/wp-content/uploads/2024/09/HD-33-300x300.jpg 300w, https://hdmarine.com.tr/wp-content/uploads/2024/09/HD-33-150x150.jpg 150w, https://hdmarine.com.tr/wp-content/uploads/2024/09/HD-33-100x100.jpg 100w, https://hdmarine.com.tr/wp-content/uploads/2024/09/HD-33.jpg 500w\" sizes=\"100vw\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-046941f e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"046941f\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-6a6c107 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"6a6c107\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-608791f elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"608791f\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><strong>Vakum pompaları</strong>, içindeki hava veya gaz moleküllerini çekerek bir sistemde negatif basınç oluşturur. Bu sayede <strong>vakumlu ortam yaratma, gaz tahliyesi ve ortam havasını boşaltma</strong> gibi kritik endüstriyel uygulamalarda güvenilir performans sağlar. Sanayi, kimya, laboratuvar, üretim hatları, paketleme ve proses kontrol sistemlerinde yaygın şekilde kullanılır.</p><p>HD Marine vakum pompaları, dayanıklı yapısı, hassas emiş gücü ve yüksek verimliliği ile <strong>sürekli çalışma koşullarında dahi etkin sonuç sunar.</strong></p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-036b956 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"036b956\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-bda0143 elementor-view-stacked elementor-position-inline-start elementor-tablet-position-inline-end elementor-shape-circle elementor-mobile-position-block-start elementor-widget elementor-widget-icon-box\" data-id=\"bda0143\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"icon-box.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-icon-box-wrapper\">\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-icon-box-icon\">\n\t\t\t\t<span  class=\"elementor-icon\">\n\t\t\t\t<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"e-font-icon-svg e-fas-table\" viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M464 32H48C21.49 32 0 53.49 0 80v352c0 26.51 21.49 48 48 48h416c26.51 0 48-21.49 48-48V80c0-26.51-21.49-48-48-48zM224 416H64v-96h160v96zm0-160H64v-96h160v96zm224 160H288v-96h160v96zm0-160H288v-96h160v96z\"></path></svg>\t\t\t\t</span>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-icon-box-content\">\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"elementor-icon-box-title\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span  >\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tVakum Pompası Teknik Değer Tablosu\t\t\t\t\t\t</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t</h3>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-0a2aa75 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"0a2aa75\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<table width=\"514\"><tbody><tr><td width=\"185\">Özellik</td><td width=\"329\">Değer</td></tr><tr><td width=\"185\">Pompa Tipi</td><td width=\"329\">Yağlı / Kuru Tip / Sulu Tip Vakum Pompası</td></tr><tr><td width=\"185\">Çalışma Prensibi</td><td width=\"329\">Negatif Basınç (Vakum) Oluşturma</td></tr><tr><td width=\"185\">Maksimum Debi</td><td width=\"329\">10 – 600 m³/h (modele göre)</td></tr><tr><td width=\"185\">Maksimum Vakum Seviyesi</td><td width=\"329\">0.1 – 5 mbar</td></tr><tr><td width=\"185\">Motor Gücü</td><td width=\"329\">0.37 – 7.5 kW</td></tr><tr><td width=\"185\">Voltaj</td><td width=\"329\">220V / 380V</td></tr><tr><td width=\"185\">Bağlantı Çapı</td><td width=\"329\">1” – 3”</td></tr><tr><td width=\"185\">Gövde Malzemesi</td><td width=\"329\">Döküm / Paslanmaz Çelik</td></tr><tr><td width=\"185\">Koruma Sınıfı</td><td width=\"329\">IP55</td></tr><tr><td width=\"185\">Çalışma Sıcaklığı</td><td width=\"329\">5°C – 40°C</td></tr><tr><td width=\"185\">Montaj Tipi</td><td width=\"329\">Yatay</td></tr><tr><td width=\"185\">Soğutma Tipi</td><td width=\"329\">Hava Soğutmalı</td></tr><tr><td width=\"185\">Bakım Aralığı</td><td width=\"329\">Periyodik Yağ Kontrolü</td></tr></tbody></table>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-08b3ec7 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-child\" data-id=\"08b3ec7\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-bb2fc2a e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"bb2fc2a\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-f9a0c79 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-child\" data-id=\"f9a0c79\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-e4d1ef5 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\"